# A selection made while the view is scrolled back takes the scrollback's
# text, and a drag from the scrollback onto the screen copies across both.
# spec: ADR-1003, the selection; INTERFACE-vtium.md, The selection and copy
# covers: clipboard.selection
size 6 2
scrollback 10
send "l1\r\nl2\r\nl3\r\nl4\r\nl5"
scroll up 3
dump
select word at 0,0
copy
select start at 0,1
scroll bottom
select to at 1,1
copy
dump frame
